@budget_financing
title: The arithmetic behind the promise
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1

= Every promise needs an owner

Current package: **[+ annual_budget_strategy +]**.

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Frame before financing</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Social and public services</span><b>[+ annual_budget_social_share +]%</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Floor [+ annual_budget_social_floor +]%.</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Defence</span><b>[+ annual_budget_defence_share +]%</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Floor [+ annual_budget_defence_floor +]%.</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Deficit</span><b>[+ annual_budget_deficit_share +]%</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Ceiling [+ annual_budget_deficit_ceiling +]%.</div></div>

The financing choice changes the bill rather than adding a detached political
bonus. It will be visible to caucuses, coalition partners and the Senate.

- @finance_progressive_revenue
- @finance_kpo_cofinance
- @finance_borrowing
- @finance_spending_restraint

@finance_progressive_revenue
title: Finance the package with top-income, property and windfall revenue
subtitle: Narrows the deficit and pleases the economic Left; market liberals will demand proof that the yield is real.
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_financing = "Progressive revenue package";
Q.annual_budget_progressive_revenue = 1;
Q.annual_budget_deficit_share = Math.round(
    Math.max(2.5, Number(Q.annual_budget_deficit_share) - 1.2) * 10
) / 10;
Q.annual_budget_projected_balance = -Q.annual_budget_deficit_share;
Q.annual_budget_demands_text +=
    "; financed by top-income, property and windfall revenue";
Q.news_headline = "The budget places new progressive revenue behind its promises";
!}
go-to: internal_ratification

@finance_kpo_cofinance
title: Match eligible investment with an unlocked KPO block
subtitle: Uses one uncommitted recovery block and lowers domestic borrowing; it cannot finance recurring wages.
