@opposition_deadline_demand
title: Demand talks on a lawful early-election route
subtitle: A political demand is not a dissolution decree.
on-arrival: {!
Q.snap_election_requested = 1;
Q.snap_election_request_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.snap_election_request_year = Number(Q.year) || Q.annual_budget_year;
Q.snap_election_request_month = Number(Q.month) || 12;
Q.snap_election_reason = "Opposition demand after a defeated annual budget";
Q.snap_event_deferred_time = -1;
Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(70, Number(Q.early_election_risk) || 0);
Q.annual_budget_result += " — lawful election talks requested";
Q.news_headline = "Lewica demands a constitutional election route without inventing one";
!}
go-to: return_queue

@opposition_hold_deadline
title: Keep opposing and let the constitutional clock run
subtitle: The President's Article 225 discretion appears only after the four-month deadline expires.
view-if: caretaker_government = 0
on-arrival: {! 
Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
Q.annual_budget_result += " — deadline remains active";
Q.news_headline = "The cabinet remains in office while the budget deadline runs";
!}
go-to: return_queue

@opposition_caretaker_formation
title: Proceed to the caretaker government's formation vote
subtitle: A caretaker without confidence must test the constitutional formation stages.
view-if: caretaker_government = 1
on-arrival: snap_formation_context = "Budget-defeat caretaker formation"; snap_formation_attempt = 1; snap_election_requested = 0; news_headline = "The caretaker budget defeat moves into a cabinet-formation vote"
go-to: poland_events_2026.snap_formation_attempt_one

@budget_vote
title: The Sejm votes on the budget package
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
const budgetModel = (typeof window !== "undefined"
    ? window : globalThis).polandBudgetModel;
const defectorLow = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_forecast_defectors_low) || 0)
);
const defectorHigh = Math.max(
    defectorLow,
    Math.round(
        Number(Q.annual_budget_forecast_defectors_high) || defectorLow
    )
);
const defectorDraw = defectorLow +
    this.random.uint32() % (defectorHigh - defectorLow + 1);
const roll = budgetModel.rollCall({
    sejmTotal: Q.sejm_total,
    quorum: Q.sejm_quorum_floor,
    governmentSeats: Q.annual_budget_forecast_government_seats,
    malcontents: Q.annual_budget_malcontents,
    externalYes: Q.annual_budget_forecast_external_yes,
    externalNo: Q.annual_budget_forecast_external_no,
    whipBonus: Q.annual_budget_whip_bonus,
    defectors: defectorDraw
});
Q.annual_budget_government_yes = roll.governmentYes;
Q.annual_budget_government_no = roll.governmentNo;
Q.annual_budget_government_abstain = roll.governmentAbstain;
Q.annual_budget_yes = roll.yes;
Q.annual_budget_no = roll.no;
Q.annual_budget_abstain = roll.abstain;
Q.annual_budget_recorded_defectors = roll.defectors;
Q.annual_budget_present = roll.present;
Q.annual_budget_threshold = roll.threshold;
Q.annual_budget_passed = roll.passed;
Q.annual_budget_margin = roll.margin;
Q.annual_budget_shortfall = roll.shortfall;
Q.annual_budget_result = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? (Q.annual_budget_vote_round == 1 ? "Budget passed " : "Revised budget passed ") +
        Q.annual_budget_yes + " to " + Q.annual_budget_no
    : (Q.annual_budget_vote_round == 1 ? "Budget failed " : "Revised budget failed ") +
        Q.annual_budget_shortfall + " votes short";
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.annual_budget_year] = 1;
Q["annual_budget_passed_" + Q.annual_budget_year] = Q.annual_budget_passed;
Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
!}

= [+ annual_budget_vote_round +]. Sejm roll call

**Yes [+ annual_budget_yes +] · No [+ annual_budget_no +] · Abstain [+
annual_budget_abstain +] · Required [+ annual_budget_threshold +]**

Frame: **Social [+ annual_budget_social_share +]% · Defence [+
annual_budget_defence_share +]% · Deficit [+ annual_budget_deficit_share +]%**.

[? if annual_budget_recorded_defectors > 0: **[+
annual_budget_recorded_defectors +]** of the cabinet's own deputies refused the
whip on the record. The names outlive the vote.?]

[? if annual_budget_passed: The bill carries with **[+ annual_budget_margin +]
more yes than no**. Its fiscal effects are not applied yet: the Senate may
amend the text before the President receives it.?]
[? if not annual_budget_passed: The bill falls **[+ annual_budget_shortfall +]
vote(s)** short. The cabinet remains in office; one emergency revision,
confidence, resignation and self-dissolution are separate choices.?]

- @budget_vote_continue: Record the roll call

@budget_vote_continue
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
go-to: budget_passed if annual_budget_passed = 1 and annual_budget_vote_round = 1; budget_failed if annual_budget_passed = 0 and annual_budget_vote_round = 1; budget_rescue_passed if annual_budget_passed = 1 and annual_budget_vote_round = 2; budget_rescue_failed if annual_budget_passed = 0 and annual_budget_vote_round = 2

@budget_passed
title: The coalition carries its first text
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 1 and annual_budget_vote_round = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_result =
    "Budget passed " + Q.annual_budget_yes + " to " + Q.annual_budget_no;
Q.news_headline = "The coalition carries the annual budget into the Senate";
!}

The government has won the Sejm vote. It has not yet enacted the original
numbers unchanged; the Senate now receives twenty days to adopt amendments.

- @senate_budget_review: Send the budget to the Senate

@budget_failed
